[2026-05-12T16:33:22.936Z] [INFO] {"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_364","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"gh pr edit 1789 --repo link-assistant/hive-mind --title \\\"fix(telegram): complete localized bot output fallbacks\\\" --body-file - <<'EOF'\n## Summary\nFixes #1788\n\n- Localizes Telegram \"'`/version`, `/limits`, solve queue, and solve rejection output for Russian plus the other supported locales.\n- Adds Telegram formatted-message error detection with a plain-text retry path, localized warning text, and verbose logging for the original formatted failure.\n- Adds issue case-study artifacts with the reported screenshots and verification logs.\n\n## Reproduction\nThe issue was reproducible from the reported Russian Telegram bot output:\n\n- `/solve` resource rejection showed an English reason such as `Disk usage is 91% (threshold: 90%)`.\n- `/version` mixed Russian text with English section titles and labels like `Platform`, `Environment`, `Development Tools`, and `Browsers`.\n- `/limits` mixed English date/time text, queue labels, and waiting reasons.\n- `/help` could fail to send when Telegram rejected Markdown formatting.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `npm run lint`\n- `for test in tests/test-telegram-safe-reply-issue-1497.mjs tests/test-version-info.mjs tests/limits-display.test.mjs tests/test-queue-display-1267.mjs tests/test-solve-queue-command.mjs; do node \"$test\" || exit $?; done`\n- `node tests/docs-validation.mjs`\n- `npm test` - all 205 selected test files passed\n\nLocal dependency install was run with `npm install --ignore-scripts` because this environment has Node v20.20.2 while `package.json` requires Node >=24.0.0. The full test suite still passed locally after install.\n\n## Artifacts\n\nCase-study materials and logs are committed under:\n\n- https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/tree/issue-1788-d09caa2c038a/docs/case-studies/issue-1788\n\nReported screenshots preserved for review:\n\n![Russian solve rejection reason](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/blob/issue-1788-d09caa2c038a/docs/case-studies/issue-1788/images/translation-reason.png?raw=true)\n\n![Russian help Markdown formatting failure](https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/blob/issue-1788-d09caa2c038a/docs/case-studies/issue-1788/images/help-format-error.png?raw=true)\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"https://github.com/link-assistant/hive-mind/pull/1789\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
